<title>SENEGAL: TENNIS-DAVIS CUP EURO/AFRICAN ZONE GROUP THREE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-DAVIS CUP EURO/AFRICAN ZONE GROUP THREE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>DAKAR 1997-01-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of matches in Davis Cup</p>
<p>Euro/African zone group three on Saturday:</p>
<p>Senegal beat Turkey 2-1</p>
<p>Baris Ergun (Turkey) beat Jean-Noel Said (Senegal) 4-6 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>Yahiya Doumbia (Senegal) beat Erhan Oral (Turkey) 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>Yahiya Doumbia/Thierno Ly (Senegal) beat Mustapha</p>
<p>Azkara/Alaaddin Karagoz (Turkey) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Luxemburg beat Macedonia 2-1</p>
<p>Johnny Goudenbour (Luxemburg) beat Lazar Magdincev (Macedonia)</p>
<p>6-2 6-3</p>
<p>Zoran Sevcenko (Macedonia) beat Sacha Thoma (Luxemburg) 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>Adrian Graimprey/Johnny Goudenbour (Luxemburg) beat Lazar</p>
<p>Magdincev/Zoran Sevcenko (Macedonia) 7-6 6-2</p>
<p>San Marino beat Armenia 3-0</p>
<p>Christian Rosti (San Marino) beat Anri Makichian (Armenia) 6-1</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>Domenico Vicini (San Marino) beat Artak Harutyunyan (Armenia)</p>
<p>5-7 7-5 6-3</p>
<p>Gabriel Francini/Domenico Vicini (San Marino) beat Haik</p>
<p>Hakopian/Anri Makichian (Armenia) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Bosnia beat Ethiopia 3-0</p>
<p>Eldar Mustafic (Bosnia) beat Samuel Gebriel (Ethiopia) 6-1 6-2</p>
<p>Merid Zahirovic (Bosnia) beat Yohannes Setegne (Ethiopia) 2-6</p>
<p>6-3 6-1.</p>
<p>Eldar Mustafic/Haris Basacic (Bosnia) beat Habtamu</p>
<p>Kidane/Yohannes Setegne (Ethiopia) 6-0 6-0</p>
</text>
